1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:05,739
Twenty-three tabs. Four apps. A folder of screenshots you'll never find again.

2
00:00:06,995 --> 00:00:08,769
Research shouldn't look like this.

3
00:00:09,277 --> 00:00:10,503
Meet Axiom.

4
00:00:14,441 --> 00:00:24,256
Paper on the left, thinking on the right. Lasso anything: text lands as Markdown, equations as LaTeX, and every snippet links back to its exact spot.

5
00:00:27,532 --> 00:00:34,370
Need space? Spread two fingers and the page opens up. Sketch roughly, double-tap, and it snaps clean.

6
00:00:36,259 --> 00:00:42,421
Type LaTeX and it renders live. Link ideas with double brackets, and backlinks build themselves.

7
00:00:44,986 --> 00:00:50,252
Tag a note as a flashcard. Axiom schedules reviews right before you'd forget.

8
00:00:53,714 --> 00:00:59,700
Search everything in a keystroke, see how ideas connect, and gather a whole topic into one Lens.

9
00:01:02,441 --> 00:01:09,527
Write on your laptop and watch it appear on your tablet. Real-time, end-to-end encrypted, and fully offline.

10
00:01:13,350 --> 00:01:19,673
Every page is plain Markdown in your own GitHub or GitLab repo. Full history. Zero lock-in.

11
00:01:22,077 --> 00:01:32,273
And AI that reads your handwriting, transcribes equations, suggests tags and writes your flashcards. Free tiers, a local model, or no key at all.

12
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:37,661
That's Axiom.

13
00:01:38,561 --> 00:01:40,891
Now let's set it up. Start the clock.

14
00:01:43,546 --> 00:01:47,750
Clone, install, run. Three commands, Node 20 or newer.

15
00:01:52,273 --> 00:01:56,973
Click Install, or Add to Home Screen on iPad. It works offline from here.

16
00:01:58,818 --> 00:02:02,318
Drop in a PDF, EPUB or slide deck.

17
00:02:05,364 --> 00:02:10,762
Start the relay, create a sync key, paste it on your other device. Connected and encrypted.

18
00:02:14,091 --> 00:02:22,277
Now backup. Create a GitHub token for one repo, paste it into Settings, and every change is committed automatically.

19
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:31,724
Finally, AI. Grab a free Gemini key, paste it in, hit Test. Prefer local? Point it at Ollama.

20
00:02:35,409 --> 00:02:36,255
Done.

21
00:02:41,873 --> 00:02:42,872
Axiom.

22
00:02:42,922 --> 00:02:45,043
Free. Open source. Yours.
